1
00:00:00,920 --> 00:00:03,420
(Woman at Door:)All right.
Sheldon, what's on your mind?

2
00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:07,260
(Sheldon:)I wronged Howard,
and he won't accept my apology.

3
00:00:07,260 --> 00:00:08,430
(Penny:)Oh, right, that.

4
00:00:08,430 --> 00:00:10,600
(Penny:)Yes, Leonard told me.
Sorry, honey.

5
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:13,770
(Sheldon:)Penny, you face failure
on a daily basis.

6
00:00:15,230 --> 00:00:16,940
(Sheldon:)How do you cope?

7
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:19,040
(Penny:)I drink.

8
00:00:20,110 --> 00:00:22,460
(Sheldon:)To drinking.

9
00:00:25,280 --> 00:00:27,610
(Sheldon:)Nope.

10
00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:31,880
(Sheldon:)Oh, if only there were some way

11
00:00:31,880 --> 00:00:33,690
(Sheldon:)to force Howard
to accept my apology

12
00:00:33,690 --> 00:00:36,760
(Sheldon:)so I could escape
this miasma of guilt.

13
00:00:36,760 --> 00:00:38,360
(Penny:)You know, sometimes
stuff just happens,

14
00:00:38,360 --> 00:00:40,090
(Penny:)and there's nothing
you can do about it.

15
00:00:40,090 --> 00:00:41,390
(Penny:)For example, Lisa Peterson

16
00:00:41,390 --> 00:00:43,230
(Penny:)hasn't talked to me
since the 11th grade,

17
00:00:43,230 --> 00:00:45,230
(Penny:)because no matter how
much you apologize,

18
00:00:45,230 --> 00:00:48,900
(Penny:)you can't go back and
un-dry-hump someone's boyfriend.

19
00:00:49,740 --> 00:00:51,140
(Page:)I see.

20
00:00:51,140 --> 00:00:54,310
(Sheldon:)You're saying I'm facing
Starfleet Academy's

21
00:00:54,310 --> 00:00:57,680
unwinnable command scenario:
the Kobayashi Maru.

22
00:00:57,680 --> 00:00:58,840
(Penny:)Exactly.

23
00:00:58,850 --> 00:01:00,110
(Penny:)Sometimes you can't win.

